<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's May producer price index rises 0.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's May producer price index rises 0.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's May General Index of Industrial Producer Prices rose 0.8 percent to 121.9 from April.</p>
<p>Year-over-year, May prices gained 0.4 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>			     May 97    Apr 97   May 96</p>
<p>General Index	    121.9     120.9    121.4</p>
<p>Monthly change	     0.8 pct -0.4 pct</p>
<p>Year-on-year change	0.4 pct  0.9 pct</p>
<p>Extractive industry    119.5     119.5    117.8</p>
<p>Manufacturing industry 119.4     119.0    119.0</p>
<p>Textile industry	 117.7     117.8    117.2</p>
<p>BASE: 1993=100</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
